# The build context of the first-party images (infra/<service>/Dockerfile). A secret, an installed dependency
# and a build output never enter an image: they are mounted, installed or generated inside it.
.env*
# At any depth: a pattern without a slash matches the context's root alone, and infra/gateway/.env and
# infra/observability/.env hold provider and Langfuse keys.
**/.env*
node_modules
.next
out
build
coverage
.git
lib/db/generated
pipeline/reports
*.tsbuildinfo
infra/keycloak/vault
infra/keycloak/.rendered
